{"id":"2c18125c091d1dde","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-well-founded.md","title":"沿下降方向良基","display":"df-well-founded — 沿下降方向良基","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-well-founded","aliases":["56-df-well-founded"],"display":"df-well-founded — 沿下降方向良基","depends_on":["[[56-df-binary-relation]]"],"source_section":"§1.1 Definition 1.1.13(iii), following paragraph","source_printed_pages":"13","source_ocr_blocks":[34],"source_verification":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-well-founded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-well-founded</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-well-founded — 沿下降方向良基"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"08f06f47fa573f5c\" href=\"?note=08f06f47fa573f5c\" title=\"56-df-binary-relation\">56-df-binary-relation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.1 Definition 1.1.13(iii), following paragraph"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"13"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>34</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&gt;\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(&gt;\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"08f06f47fa573f5c\" href=\"?note=08f06f47fa573f5c\" title=\"56-df-binary-relation\">56-df-binary-relation</a>；工作于ZFC。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(A,&gt;)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\neg\\exists f\\in A^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(n)&gt;f(n+1)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WF}(A,&gt;)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\neg\\exists f\\in A^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(n)&gt;f(n+1)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本目录把&gt;的左端到右端规定为下降方向，因此WF排除a₀&gt;a₁&gt;a₂&gt;⋯。原书附录采用相反的前驱方向来称关系良基；正文p13因此写终止→等价于其逆关系←良基。本原子的WF(A,→)直接沿归约方向使用，与正文终止性质相同。原文件的方向已据此纠正，不把WF额外要求成严格序。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-binary-relation","status":"resolved","id":"08f06f47fa573f5c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-binary-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-binary-relation","status":"resolved","id":"08f06f47fa573f5c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 为集合，$>\\subseteq A\\times A$，见 [[56-df-binary-relation]]；工作于ZFC。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":">\\subseteq A\\times A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}(A,>)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\neg\\exists f\\in A^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(n)>f(n+1)).","display":true}],"bytes":1275,"backlinks":[{"id":"ea6d0d000271b1cf","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$，$V$ 为变量集，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$>\\subseteq T^2$；替换、单孔上下文及下降方向良基性分别见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]、[[56-df-context]]、[[56-df-well-founded]]。$R\\subseteq T^2$ 为规则集合；另取任意集合 $A$ 与 $Q\\subseteq A^2$，用于通用严格序缩写。本定义把序本身的性质与它对规则的定向分开。"},{"id":"a0c9e286170288bf","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿归约方向的 $\\mathrm{WF}(A,\\to)$ 见 [[56-df-well-founded]]。"},{"id":"54517e5af9b2ee4a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$，$A\\ne\\varnothing$ 为集合，$I\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}$ 为具有指定元数的全运算族；$\\mathrm{Algebra}_\\Sigma(A,I)$ 见 [[56-df-structure]]，$Q\\subseteq A^2$。以下两个性质谓词均在这一合格代数参数域内定义。$\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,Q)$ 见 [[56-df-reduction-order]]，$\\mathrm{WF}(A,Q)$ 见 [[56-df-well-founded]]，沿左端到右端的下降方向解释；$[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-well-founded.md]]"},{"id":"ac167a6d94ee8495","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"工作于 ZFC。设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$，$|F|<\\aleph_0$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$Q\\subseteq T^2$ 且 $\\mathrm{SimplOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(Q)$，见 [[56-df-simplification-order]]。变量集 $V$ 可数无限。$\\mathrm{WF}$、$\\mathrm{RedOrd}$ 取该定义及 [[56-df-well-founded]] 的接口；证明所需的有限变量片段嵌入结论为 [[56-thm-finite-signature-tree-embedding]]。"},{"id":"fa249af3230be7c7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"415b9e19f223c427","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e492786084299d72","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SN}$、$\\mathrm{Terminating}$、$\\mathrm{WF}$ 分别见 [[56-df-strongly-normalizing]]、[[56-df-terminating]]、[[56-df-well-founded]]。"}],"outgoing":["08f06f47fa573f5c"]}